Camp Fire Creation
    Events
        Unit - A unit Finishes construction
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Camp Fire
    Actions
        Set VariableSet CampFirePoint = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Unit Group - Add (Triggering unit) to CampFireGroup
        -------- First ability for visua buff --------
        Unit - Add Warmth  to (Triggering unit)
        -------- Second is used as HP / MANA increasing --------
        Unit - Add Warmth (HP) to (Triggering unit)
        Unit - Add Warmth (Mana) to (Triggering unit)
        Unit - Add a 60.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Triggering unit)
        Unit - Create 1 Light for Neutral Passive at CampFirePoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_CampFirePoint)
        -------- Turn on Triggers to get Rested XP --------
        Custom script:   call AddCampfire(GetTriggerUnit())
